<section image-layout="blank" id="7L1wV4aXXH"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="hm_2MKaUJG"><labels><label variant="solid">REQUEST · POST /login</label><label variant="outline">ILLUSTRATIVE UI</label></labels><h2>Browser to POST /login</h2><p>Asha enters <b>asha@campus.example</b> and a masked password. A server-issued CSRF value travels with the form; the password is never echoed or logged.</p><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="A9hxU7fU8c" cell-style="subtle" padding="0" colspan="36"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none"><grid-item id="r56mx0Grin" background-color="surface" padding="7pt 12pt" rowspan="8"><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="Kz59O808oF"><p font-size="sm">● ● ●</p></grid-item><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><grid-item id="ZkTkoVENGo"><p font-size="sm">portal.campus.example/login</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="P-OYcxIZtg" padding="12pt 18pt" rowspan="52"><p role="eyebrow">STUDENT AUTHENTICATION PORTAL</p><h3>Sign in</h3><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item colspan="34"><p font-size="sm">Email</p><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="6q9r6ILhS1" background-color="surface" padding="7pt 10pt"><p>asha@campus.example</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="sm">Password</p><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="uX7oplrfW2" background-color="surface" padding="7pt 10pt"><p>••••••••••••</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item colspan="26"><p font-size="sm"><b>Hidden form value</b><br/><code>_csrf=server-issued token</code></p><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="PWMkZmDKmz" background-color="accent" padding="8pt 10pt"><p align="center"><b>Sign in securely</b></p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="W8KDIw_gtw" colspan="24"><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="U9TU9cLMHE" cell-style="subtle" padding="12pt 14pt" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">DEVTOOLS · REQUEST</p><h4>POST /login</h4><p font-size="sm">email · password · _csrf</p></grid-item><grid-item id="YvsFIFF3zK" background-color="palette-3" padding="12pt 14pt" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">SUCCESS</p><h4>303 See Other</h4><p font-size="sm">Location: /dashboard<br/>Set-Cookie: sid=opaque</p></grid-item><grid-item id="FC7HyZmE_3" cell-style="subtle" padding="12pt 14pt" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">GENERIC FAILURE</p><h4>401 Unauthorized</h4><p font-size="sm">“Email or password is incorrect.”</p></grid-item><grid-item id="6t0h_cOewo" background-color="surface" padding="12pt 14pt" colspan="30"><p font-size="sm"><b>Invariant:</b> no password appears in the response, logs, cookie, or browser storage.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>